{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Python code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Python 3 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Python 3 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport sys, bisect\n\ndef dfs_all(arr, idx, cur, mod, out):\n    if idx == len(arr):\n        out.add(cur)\n        return\n    dfs_all(arr, idx+1, (cur + arr[idx]) % mod, mod, out)\n    dfs_all(arr, idx+1, cur, mod, out)\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    m = int(data[1])\n    a = [int(x) % m for x in data[2:2+n]]\n    half = n // 2\n    left = set()\n    right = set()\n    dfs_all(a[:half], 0, 0, m, left)\n    dfs_all(a[half:], 0, 0, m, right)\n    right = sorted(right)\n    best = 0\n    for i in left:\n        pos = bisect.bisect_left(right, m - i) - 1\n        best = max(best, i + right[pos])\n    print(best)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static void dfsAll(int[] arr, int idx, int cur, int mod, Set<Integer> out) {\n        if (idx == arr.length) {\n            out.add(cur);\n            return;\n        }\n        dfsAll(arr, idx + 1, (cur + arr[idx]) % mod, mod, out);\n        dfsAll(arr, idx + 1, cur, mod, out);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        String[] data = br.readLine().split(\"\\\\s+\");\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(data[0]);\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(data[1]);\n        int[] a = new int[n];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            a[i] = Integer.parseInt(data[2 + i]) % m;\n        }\n        int half = n / 2;\n        Set<Integer> left = new HashSet<>();\n        Set<Integer> right = new HashSet<>();\n        dfsAll(Arrays.copyOfRange(a, 0, half), 0, 0, m, left);\n        dfsAll(Arrays.copyOfRange(a, half, n), 0, 0, m, right);\n        List<Integer> rightList = new ArrayList<>(right);\n        Collections.sort(rightList);\n        int best = 0;\n        for (int i : left) {\n            int target = m - i;\n            int pos = Collections.binarySearch(rightList, target);\n            if (pos < 0) {\n                pos = -pos - 2;\n            } else {\n                pos -= 1;\n            }\n            if (pos >= 0) {\n                best = Math.max(best, i + rightList.get(pos));\n            }\n        }\n        System.out.println(best);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-4.887569e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -1.7881233e-05, -1.0967195e-05, -2.3841855e-07, -1.5019299, -0.07926039, -1.1920928e-07, 0.0, -5.960463e-07, -0.00034981806, -8.344616e-06, 0.0, -0.0046018413, -0.014168738, -0.100220494, -0.5035581, -0.003055311, -0.0022525433, -0.02999767, -0.064520024, -1.1920858e-05, -4.1723165e-06, -2.3841855e-07, -1.1920928e-07, -2.9086643e-05, 0.0, -0.029750533, -1.2516897e-05, -1.633154e-05, -1.7881378e-06, -3.576278e-07, -8.344647e-07, -0.025231618, -1.4305105e-06, 0.0, -0.000711069, -2.0861407e-05, -1.072883e-06, -2.3841855e-07, -4.2915253e-06, -3.576278e